@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Capability degraded, recovering and failed states
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

[*] --> Assessing
Assessing --> Ready : actual prerequisites verified
Assessing --> Unavailable : required capability absent
Ready --> Degraded : scoped dependency loss; safe remaining features
Ready --> Failed : cannot safely admit affected work
Degraded --> Recovering : controlled restoration begins
Failed --> Recovering : permitted repair route
Unavailable --> Recovering : prerequisite established
Recovering --> Ready : usability / authority / unresolved work checks pass
Recovering --> Failed : consistency or safety checks fail
note right of Recovering
 Process boot alone is insufficient.
 No automatic replay of restored sends or deployments.
 States are proposed capability observations, not product enums.
end note

@enduml
